{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "108", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "2 matches, 2 one-sided victories. Will it be any different in the third? West Indies have looked a far better side than Afghanistan and will be aiming for a clean sweep in the final T20I. The visitors, on the other hand, will hope for a consolation win and stave off some respect. Join us on Monday, June 5, 2017, from this same venue, at 1930 local (2330 GMT) for all the action from the third and final T20I. Till then, you can catch all the action from the Champions Trophy. Adios! Take Care!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "107", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "KESRICK WILLIAMS has been named the MAN OF THE MATCH for his 3/11 in 2.3 overs. Says that when you put in a lot of hard work, it feels good to see yourself doing well for your team. Adds that he just executed what his captain asked of him. Feels that it is not a great challenge, to just execute what your skipper asks you to. But he does admit that it is a great challenge to bowl well in T20s which is not a bowler-friendly format.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "106", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Victorious West Indian captain, CARLOS BRATHWAITE says that it is always a good feeling to win a series, no matter who is the opposition. Feels that the conditions were difficult to bat, especially with the intermittent weather. Was confident of the game resuming irrespective of how long it rained. Says that he had told his team to expect play anytime once the rain stopped. Is proud of the way his team played tonight.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "105", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Afghanistan skipper, ASGHAR STANIKZAI admits his side is disappointed, especially this being a chaseable target. On being asked about lack of consistency against top nations, he averts the question by saying that they are learning a lot by playing this series and credits the Windies, saying they deserve to win the series.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "104", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Another dejecting batting display from Afghanistan. They tend to panic if they play out a few dot balls and lead to self-destruction. They were unable to read Badree early on and got consumed by the increasing required rate. If they had not thrown away their wickets, then maybe, given the firepower they possess, they could have chased it down. Just three double figures in the innings. Stay tuned for the presentation.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "103", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Every bowler got a wicket with Williams being the pick, taking 3 wickets. Brathwaite was excellent again, with a 2-fer. Narine had a rare off evening.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "102", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "123 in 15 overs looked possible, especially for an Afghan side which bats so deep. But losing wickets at regular intervals never made things easy. The shot selection was not the best, neither was the running between the wickets. Credit to West Indies - they bowled with pace and accuracy and rarely gave bad balls, inducing constant pressure.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "101", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Another clinical display from the Windies. Wonder why they cannot pull off such performances with more consistency against top nations. They have blown off Afghanistan twice in 2 games, looking ever so dominant.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.3", "Id": "100", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63796", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "OUT! A series victory for West Indies. A full ball outside off, Janat looks to go big down the ground but gets more height than distance. Carlos Brathwaite takes a few steps to his right from mid off and takes it calmly. WEST INDIES WIN BY 29 RUNS (DLS METHOD) AND TAKE AN UNASSAILABLE 2-0 SERIES LEAD.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "65875", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.2", "Id": "99", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63796", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "Oh wow... full and on the pads, Karim gets down and across and attempts a lovely flick. The shot looks beautiful, except that he is beaten by the change in pace and is months early into the shot. The ball hits the back of the bat and lobs behind the keeper. Two runs taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.1", "Id": "98", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63796", "Batsman": "10104", "Commentary": "On a good length outside off, Hamza hops and pushes it straight to point. The fielder charges to the ball but decides not to throw as there is no one backing up at either end. A single allowed to be taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "97", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "KESRICK WILLIAMS to bowl out. Can he finish this innings off?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.6", "Id": "96", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3499", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "Full and wide outside off, Janat swings but misses.", "Summary": {"Score": "90/9", "Over": "13", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65875", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "18", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "10104", "Runs": "5", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3499", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.5", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3499", "Batsman": "10104", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, pushed through the covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3499", "Batsman": "10104", "Commentary": "Almost the end of the match. Amir taps this to the off side and sets off for a suicidal run, before being sent back by his partner at the right time. Taylor gets to the ball and has a shy at the striker's end but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3499", "Batsman": "10104", "Commentary": "FOUR! Not a bad shot for a number 11. On the pads, Hamza gracefully works it behind square leg and beats the fielder from short fine leg.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "AMIR HAMZA is the last man in.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3499", "Batsman": "56960", "Commentary": "OUT! BOWLED! Excellent bowling. A full delivery, right on middle stump, Dawlat backs away to the leg side and attempts a hit  through the off side but the ball swings away slightly, beats the bat and hits the off stump. A perfect delivery to a tail-ender.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "56960", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3499", "Batsman": "56960", "Commentary": "A length ball outside off, Dawlat backs away and carves this over cover. Long off gets around and keeps the batsmen to a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "JEROME TAYLOR is back on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "SIX! Nice fun. Bowl short, get hit. Brathwaite does that and Janat is ready. Pulls it magnificently over mid-wicket. 18 from the over, which is well beyond the required rate of 14.5. But sadly, only 2 wickets in hand to not even dream of getting 40 from the remaining 3 overs.", "Summary": {"Score": "83/8", "Over": "12", "Runs": "18", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65875", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "18", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "56960", "Runs": "7", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "56973", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "26", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "MISFIELD, FOUR! Full on middle, Janat works it wide of long on. Substitute Jonathan Carter, who is on the field for Samuel Badree, does well to cover good ground to his right, gets to the ball, puts in the slide but then messes it up as the ball goes off his legs to the fence.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "56960", "Commentary": "A short ball on middle, Dawlat swings but gets a top edge. The bowler cannot get to it and the result is a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "A fine yorker on middle, pushed to the leg side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "SIX! ADMONISHED! This is short and outside off, Janat gets across and pulls it massively over square leg for a maximum.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "A length ball outside off, angling in, Janat swings hard but misses. The ball just whizzes over the stumps. Brathwaite starts to celebrate, thinking it is a wicket, before realizing the actual event.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "b", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "56960", "Commentary": "FOUR BYES. That beats everyone. Flighted around middle and leg, Dawlat looks to go for another big one but the ball spins in, beats his bat, misses the leg stump, beats the keeper and races away to the fine leg fence.", "Summary": {"Score": "65/8", "Over": "11", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "56960", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "6", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "65875", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "24", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "56960", "Commentary": "SIX! Fine shot. Full and outside off, Dawlat comes forward and just lofts this through the line, high and handsome over long off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "DAWLAT ZADRAN walks in at number 10, replacing Rashid.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "65748", "Commentary": "OUT! Another one chops it on. Landed outside off, Rashid goes back to punch the ball through the covers but the ball comes ever so slowly off the surface, keeps a bit low, takes the bottom edge and disturbs the stumps.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "65748", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "65748", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, Rashid looks to sweep but misses and is hit on the pads. There is a mild LBW appeal but the impact is outside off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "That ball has taken the inside edge onto the pads. One run added to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "65748", "Commentary": "Outside off, pushed towards point for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "A length ball outside off, punched to the off side.", "Summary": {"Score": "53/7", "Over": "10", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65875", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "65748", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "56973", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "A short ball outside off, Karim goes for the pull but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "Landed around off, watchfully defended.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65748", "Commentary": "On a good length outside off, steered to third man for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "RASHID KHAN walks in at number 9, replacing Najibullah.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "OUT! Drags it back on! On a good length outside off, Najibullah gives himself room to the leg side and attempts a shot through the off side but can only chop the ball onto the stumps. The ball came slowly off the pitch there. Second wicket for the skipper.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "57991", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "A short ball around off, pulled straight to short mid-wicket.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "Driven towards the mid off region. The batsmen have run through for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "52/6", "Over": "9", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "57991", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "11", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "65875", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "FOUR! Full and in line of the stumps, Najibullah plays a powerful sweep through square leg for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "Outside off, dabbed to third man for another brace.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "The batsman has played it fine down the leg side for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, slogged to deep mid-wicket for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "57991", "Commentary": "Full on middle, flicked straight to short mid-wicket.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "A short ball outside off, Karim flashes but misses.", "Summary": {"Score": "41/6", "Over": "8", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "2", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65875", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "57991", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "56973", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, pushed straight to cover. No run this time.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "NAJIBULLAH ZADRAN walks in at number 8, replacing Shafiqullah.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "65875", "Commentary": "OUT! Shafiqullah has to go. Tragic batting going on. Janat pushes this full ball through the covers and sets off for a single. Shafiqullah responds then but then Janat goes back. Shafiquallah keeps on running and in the meanwhile, Kesrick Williams comes charging in from cover, gets to the ball and has a diving under-arm flick at the bowler's end. There is no one at the stumps but he meets a bull's eye. The umpires are not too sure who is out as both batsmen are at the striker's end. They refer it upstairs and replays show that Janat just about got in before his partner crossed him.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "7800", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Another run out! But both batsmen are at same end. Who is gone? Decision referred upstairs...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "7800", "Commentary": "The batsman has flicked the ball off his pads for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SHAFIQULLAH SHAFIQ walks in at number 7, replacing Stanikzai.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "7795", "Commentary": "OUT! Gone next ball. A short delivery again, outside off, Stanikzai tries a repeat dose of the previous ball but only manages a top edge. Simple catch for Lendl Simmons at short mid-wicket.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "7795", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "56973", "Batsman": "7795", "Commentary": "SIX! WHOOSH! A short ball outside off, Stanikzai pulls it massively over mid-wicket for a biggie!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "CARLOS BRATHWAITE comes on to bowl as well.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "KARIM JANAT comes on to bat at number 6, replacing Nabi.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "7797", "Commentary": "OUT! Gone by a yard. Down the leg side, Nabi misses his flick. He wants a single and Stanikzai responds but then stops in his tracks. Nabi is sold a dummy down the river and has nowhere to go. He tries to return but by then, the throw comes in from short fine leg to the keeper who whips off the bails and celebrates. The appeal is referred upstairs and replays show that Nabi is gone.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "7797", "Summary": {"Score": "34/4", "Over": "7", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "7797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "7795", "Runs": "3", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11229", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mix-up and a run out chance! Referred upstairs... is Nabi in trouble?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "7797", "Commentary": "Landed around off, spinning away, Nabi is surprised and ends up playing it back to the bowler on his back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "7795", "Commentary": "Down the leg side, Stanikzai misses his flick and is hit on the pads.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "7795", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, pushed back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "7797", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, Mohammad reaches out and sweeps it to deep backward square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11229", "Batsman": "7797", "Commentary": "FOUR! Landed outside off, Nabi runs it down to third man for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", 