e so easily been the third wicket of the over. On the pads, Nabi swivels and flicks it straight to Taylor at short fine leg and the ball nearly carries.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63796", "Batsman": "7797", "Commentary": "Outside off, pushed to the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "MOHAMMAD NABI walks in at number 5, replacing Stanikzai to face the hat-trick ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63796", "Batsman": "7798", "Commentary": "OUT! Caught! 2 in 2! A good length delivery outside off, hurries Shenwari who tries to run it down to third man but only gets a thick outside edge. Simple catch for Walton and the bowler is on a hat-trick!", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "7798", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SAMIULLAH SHENWARI walks in at number 4, replacing Noor Ali.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63796", "Batsman": "7802", "Commentary": "OUT! Caught. A dolly. A short ball, around off, Noor Ali swings hard but only gets